<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Scholastic cut to a sell.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Scholastic cut to a sell.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell analyst Rudolf Hokanson said in a research note he lowered his recommendation on Scholastic to sell from hold.</p>
<p>-- The analyst lowered the fiscal 1997 earnings estimate to $1.50 per share from $3.25 and cut the 1998 estimate to $2.25 per share from $3.72.</p>
<p>-- The analyst cited &quot;reduced sales in children's book retail trade channel and in the book club business.&quot;</p>
</text>
